# Adapters & exporters

- Implement `BankAdapter` / `Exporter` traits; register built-ins in `adapters::builtin`.
- Parsers must be deterministic and never execute CSV content.
- Required columns missing → `AdapterError::Schema`; bad rows → `ParseReport.errors`.
- Add anonymized fixtures under `fixtures/csv/<adapter>/` with every new adapter.
- Do not commit real account numbers, full legal names, or unredacted statements.
- External plugins live under `plugins/` and depend on public traits only.
